{'symbol': 'ALL', 'date': '2022-10-25 08:30:00', 'title': 'ALLSTATE SELECTS VOYA INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT FOR PORTFOLIO MANDATE', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VOYA INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT, THE ASSET MANAGEMENT BUSINESS OF VOYA FINANCIAL, INC. (NYSE: VOYA), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WAS SELECTED BY ALLSTATE (NYSE: ALL) TO MANAGE THE FIRM'S $850 MILLION COMMERCIAL MORTGAGE PORTFOLIO EFFECTIVE NOV. 14, 2022."}